igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sce1x3.jpg"}], "slug": "revived-witch", "storyline": "In a dark forest of this continent, a lofty tower reappears, suffused with strong magic. Legend has it that the tower hides a mystical power. Countless people entered the tower for it but no one has managed to get out alive. A maiden who reposed in the forest was awakened by a soft calling from nowhere. She's a witch who doesn't remember much. To get her memories back and fulfill her destiny, she picks up her staff, wears her pointy hat, and pushes the tower's heavy doors open under the guidance of that mysterious voice.", "summary": "Revived Witch is an adventure RPG game that combines both 2D dynamic pixel art and 3D lighting. You play as a young witch who enters a mysterious tower and travels across various worlds to fulfill her destiny. You\u2019ll meet many companions with different personalities and fight with them against powerful enemies on your journey.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/revived-witch", "videos": [{"id": 54756, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "f7qYfialW-k", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f7qYfialW-k", "title": "[Revived Witch] Official Trailer 1", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/f7qYfialW-k/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 54757, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "-Eb0enoxh8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-Eb0enoxh8w", "title": "[Revived Witch] Official Trailer 2", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-Eb0enoxh8w/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}